{
	"_doc": "The one world every run is played on (D91, D92, docs/27). Chosen by doug-md on 2026-10-12 and frozen on 2026-10-14 from the generator's seed 31337 (Map F), with the Tower moved to the middle. On 2026-10-14 the great city Stormreach moved to stand at the Tower's foot and the open rank E gate Greyhollow was added near it, for the First Hour (D101). On 2026-10-15 a second open rank E gate, Elderford, was added north of the Tower, so the Guild offers a choice of two (D147). Improve it by hand: `tiles` are rows of terrain symbols (see `World.LEGEND` in src/chronicle/world.gd), `sites` the places. A run copies it and never writes back. Draw it with `tools/world_maps.tscn -- --fixed`.",
